{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-04951-00002","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["신천지 관련 확진자는 501명(오전 9시 기준)으로 전체 확진자의 절반이 넘는다","JP모건은 이날 “한국의 코로나19 상황이 최악으로 가면 최대 1만 명이 감염될 수 있다”"],"reason":"A omits the 501 confirmed cases, the facility outbreaks, and JP Morgan's 10,000-infection forecast. It also gives JP Morgan's 3% exposure premise without the conclusion it supported. The Jung Eun-kyung sentence is garbled, and the Korean is somewhat awkward."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["신천지 관련 확진자는 501명(오전 9시 기준)으로 전체 확진자의 절반이 넘는다","경북 칠곡군 밀알사랑의 집은 확진자가 총 22명이 됐다"],"reason":"B accurately covers the church member list, the 501 cases, the Milal Sarang House outbreak and the Eunpyeong hospital cases. It leaves out the quarantine-control strategy and JP Morgan's infection forecast, but it does not distort the source."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["정은경 중앙방역대책본부장(질병관리본부장)","경북 칠곡군 밀알사랑의 집은 확진자가 총 22명이 됐다"],"reason":"C accurately covers the member list, the 501 cases, the control strategy and the facility and hospital outbreaks. It omits Daegu's full testing and JP Morgan's forecast. The sentence joining the list pledge to the case count is slightly awkward."},"D":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["JP모건은 이날 “한국의 코로나19 상황이 최악으로 가면 최대 1만 명이 감염될 수 있다”","대구시민의 3%가 바이러스에 노출됐을 것이란 전제"],"reason":"D covers the 501 cases, the list pledge, Daegu's full testing and JP Morgan's worst-case forecast. It presents the 3% figure as an estimate rather than a premise. It omits the facility and hospital outbreaks and the 21만 total membership. The JP Morgan sentence is a little confusing."}}}
